        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolo suku abesifazane abayisikhombisa bayakubamba indoda eyodwa, bathi: ‘Siyakudla esethu isinkwa, sembathe ezethu izingubo; masibize igama lakho kuphela, ususe ihlazo lethu.",
